{"sections":[{"slug":"景","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"景"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"景"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">景</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">将拓扑空间上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">推广为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景上的层</span>"}},{"Plain":". <strong><span lang=\"zh\">景</span></strong> (site) <span lang=\"zh\">是带有覆盖结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">又称</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">正如拓扑空间中的开集可由子开集覆盖</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">景规定了其对象何时由一族到它的态射覆盖</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski景","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷小景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷小景</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}